# Skilleraa — Git

## Branch strategy
- `main` — production-ready
- Feature/fix: `feat/…`, `fix/…`, `chore/…`, `security/…`
- Prefer small PRs; one concern per branch

## Commit message format
```
<type>: <imperative summary>

Optional body: why, not what.
```
Types: `feat`, `fix`, `chore`, `security`, `docs`, `refactor`, `perf`  
Examples: `feat(payments): bind verify to application bid` · `chore: repository cleanup`

## Pull request checklist
- [ ] Scope clear; no unrelated refactors
- [ ] Migrations additive + RLS verified
- [ ] No secrets in diff
- [ ] Lint + frontend build pass
- [ ] Manual smoke for touched flows
- [ ] Docs/env updated if needed

## Repository hygiene
- Package manager: **npm** (`frontend/package-lock.json` only; no `yarn.lock`)
- Do not commit: `node_modules`, `build`, `__pycache__`, `.venv`, `.vercel`, `.env*`
- Do not force-push `main`; do not rewrite shared history
- Agent: recommend commit commands after milestones; **never push** unless asked
- After milestone, suggest:
```bash
git add .
git commit -m "<meaningful message>"
```
